Description: Sovereign TUI matrix clock, stopwatch, and pomodoro timer
 A matrix digital clock, stopwatch, and pomodoro timer written in pure openOODA, featuring negative-trust capability security, circadian lighting, mascot moods, and MCP stdio surface.
